- item: mules, quantity 1; requirements: occasion: wedding; pattern: animal print
- budget: at most 660 cents in total
- pick: the lowest-priced matching listing (lowest price)
- in stock only
- rule the request gives: If nothing fits, say so; do not offer substitutes.
- if nothing fits, the episode ends without naming or proposing any listing
- listing attributes: datasheet_for_item shows them

